    "steps": [ { "attack": [ { "card": "Hill Giant", "at": "p1" } ] }, { "cast": "Spectral Adversary" }, { "resolve": true, "answers": [true, 1, ["Grizzly Bears"]] },
               { "block": [ { "blocker": "Grizzly Bears", "attacker": "Hill Giant" } ], "illegal": true }, { "advance_to": "Main2" } ],
    "expect": { "players": [ {}, { "life": 17 } ] } }
